WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.199
Speaker 1: In 2023.

00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:06.009
If you still support Donald Trump.

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:10.490
You deserve to have every penny drained from
your bank account if you're giving them money,

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.900
if that's what happens to you or what you
decide to do.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:21.550
Donald Trump's fans sent him a million and
a half dollars in three days after he falsely

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.580
predicted he would be arrested on Tuesday.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.100
A fool and their money are soon parted.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.810
Does that apply here?

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.760
Business Insider reports.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:38.059
Trump wasn't arrested, but he got a big fundraising
boost, raising $1.5 million in the three days

00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:40.770
after saying he'd be arrested.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:45.810
That's nearly double the daily average he
got in the weeks before and after launching

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.699
his 2024 bid.

00:00:48.699 --> 00:00:51.800
The campaign confirmed the sum to Fox News.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:56.170
The money was said to be raised from grassroots
donations.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:01:01.820
Raising about 500,000 a day is about double
what Trump was previously averaging.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.170
The Trump campaign brought in 11.8 million
in the six weeks before the announcement,

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:08.400
which averages out to about 280,000 a day.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:15.150
In the six weeks after Trump's announcement,
he raised about 226,000 a day.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.220
But then he wrote, They're going to arrest
me.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.350
We need to protest, Take the nation back.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.600
Soros Deep State conspiracy.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.620
And on and on and on.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:27.159
And then he started including videos like
the one we just looked at, talking about how

00:01:27.159 --> 00:01:32.430
he will dismantle the deep state he started,
including those videos inside of fundraising

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:33.830
emails.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.549
And he said, we need your support.

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:37.729
Donate so we can do this.

00:01:37.729 --> 00:01:39.510
If you're not doing well, don't send any money.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:44.210
But if you can, if you can afford it, please
send me some money.

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:45.649
It is in.

00:01:45.649 --> 00:01:49.920
Is it pejorative to say that you would have
to be moronic to fall for this at this point

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:50.940
in time?

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.070
Now you might be saying.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:02:00.860
What on earth motivates an individual to give
money to a billionaire because they claim

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.170
they're about to be arrested and argue that
they are going to dismantle the so-called

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.170
deep state?

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:10.050
What on earth would motivate someone to give
that individual money?

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.750
And you have to remember that this is a cult.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:19.190
It is a cult where some in the cult believe
that Donald Trump was sent by God to save

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:25.680
the United States of America from a cabal
of Democratic pedophiles.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:26.950
If you believe that.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:31.550
It's not a very far stretch to say you're
going to spend a little bit of money.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:35.980
And that is a big part of understanding what
is going on here.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:42.760
And like I said, at this point, if you are
still a Trump supporter in 2023, it's it's

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.920
really buyer beware.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.990
And the downside, of course, is I don't want
to see people hurt.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:53.379
And for a lot of these folks donating money,
it's probably their Social Security money

00:02:53.379 --> 00:02:58.540
that's going to Trump based on the average,
you know, the disproportionately advanced

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:04.209
age of Trump supporters and the financial
reality of many of these folks.

00:03:04.209 --> 00:03:07.890
The other aspect to this, of course, is that
there's a long history.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.180
I mean, go back to the Tea Party.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:12.239
You can go back longer, but at least in the
modern era, go back to the Tea Party and you

00:03:12.239 --> 00:03:18.739
will remember people who will never benefit
from lowering taxes on the rich, voting in

00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:22.010
favor of candidates who want to lower taxes
on the rich.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.010
Why?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.010
It doesn't make sense.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.569
It's the same thing with Trump supporting
a guy who isn't going to do anything that's

00:03:26.569 --> 00:03:28.030
going to help you.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:32.470
Jonathan Haidt has really done a lot of very
good research into this.

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:35.080
It is not about voting for what I think is
best.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:40.580
For me, it's about voting for what I have
been convinced or tricked into believing.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.840
This is now my editorializing of it.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.840
What I have.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:50.960
If I can be tricked into believing that what's
best for my entire group is to support someone

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:55.510
like Trump or a candidate that will lower
taxes on the rich, I will vote that way for

00:03:55.510 --> 00:04:02.069
group cohesion, even if most of the members
of that group won't actually benefit for the

00:04:02.069 --> 00:04:04.739
thing that they are voting in favor of.

00:04:04.739 --> 00:04:09.170
You have to understand that to understand
why someone at this point would say, I'll

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:15.170
donate to Trump and I'll vote for Trump, even
though he's supposedly a billionaire and his

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.459
policies won't actually do anything for me.

00:04:17.459 --> 00:04:20.900
Read Jonathan Height's work on that and it'll
be very illuminating.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.710
Trump capitalizing on the arrest claim.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:24.930
Will he pay his lawyers?

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.190
I don't know.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.080
Will he actually get arrested next week?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.139
I don't know.

